package.1	1	conversion	sheets					zip entries stored or deflated are read
package.4	1	conversion	sheets	failed	compression method not allowed			an entry compressed otherwise ends the read of its package as compression method not allowed
package.2	1	conversion	sheets					each XML part of a package is read into nodes, the spreadsheet document's table given as a sheet
package.3	1	conversion	sheets	failed	failed			a package that is not a zip file ends the read of its package as failed
